  "segments": [
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.289854,
      "compression_ratio": 1.310638,
      "end": 5410.62,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5400.0,
      "text": "大家可以想想,牛邦,习到最后帮助在王岐山和孟的颂用下,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.289854,
      "compression_ratio": 1.310638,
      "end": 5414.08,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5410.62,
      "text": "把整个胡派共青派基本全抓完了,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.289854,
      "compression_ratio": 1.310638,
      "end": 5419.96,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5414.08,
      "text": "立着令计划这帮人,也执行了南普多计划,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.289854,
      "compression_ratio": 1.310638,
      "end": 5424.5,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5419.96,
      "text": "最后发现下个抓就是他了,他就聪明了,这家伙聪明了,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.289854,
      "compression_ratio": 1.310638,
      "end": 5429.42,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5424.5,
      "text": "他就开始要抓这个曾庆红的人了,但是动不了曾庆红,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.270978,
      "compression_ratio": 1.24,
      "end": 5433.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5429.42,
      "text": "他有王岐山有孟建柱的动不了啊,是吧?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.270978,
      "compression_ratio": 1.24,
      "end": 5439.66,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5433.0,
      "text": "那么接下来,大家看为什么习家没和张松乔、张立这人玩,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.270978,
      "compression_ratio": 1.24,
      "end": 5446.66,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5439.66,
      "text": "习家一样也不干净,肖建华就是跟乔乔,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.270978,
      "compression_ratio": 1.24,
      "end": 5452.3,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5446.66,
      "text": "还有吴天贵,还有安安,那都是有生意的。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.270978,
      "compression_ratio": 1.24,
      "end": 5456.38,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5452.3,
      "text": "肖建华在这人里面那就是一个狗屁不是?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.17723,
      "compression_ratio": 1.402116,
      "end": 5461.24,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5456.38,
      "text": "肖建华见了曾为了,就是在门口站着,肖建华的脸皮就那么厚,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.17723,
      "compression_ratio": 1.402116,
      "end": 5466.62,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5461.24,
      "text": "就是你看看田伟,你看看吴征,你看看张立,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.17723,
      "compression_ratio": 1.402116,
      "end": 5471.48,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5466.62,
      "text": "你看看徐家印,你看看张松乔,你再看肖建华,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.17723,
      "compression_ratio": 1.402116,
      "end": 5477.38,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5471.48,
      "text": "他们这些神人的背后有三个特色是常人没有的,我是没有。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.17909,
      "compression_ratio": 1.195266,
      "end": 5482.24,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5477.38,
      "text": "你看所有刚才说的那些地点,除了小白沙我去吃过饭,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.17909,
      "compression_ratio": 1.195266,
      "end": 5487.62,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5482.24,
      "text": "我一个地方没有去过,我最有资格去,我最容易去,我一次不去。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.17909,
      "compression_ratio": 1.195266,
      "end": 5492.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5487.62,
      "text": "第二,所有这些人我认识的比他们都能找,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.265919,
      "compression_ratio": 1.263736,
      "end": 5501.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5492.74,
      "text": "我跟他们一个不来往,包括曾为,我最早借给他钱是1996年的时候,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.265919,
      "compression_ratio": 1.263736,
      "end": 5508.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5501.74,
      "text": "95年借给他钱,我最能跟他来往,那时候是曾为和王妍和孙政才,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.265919,
      "compression_ratio": 1.263736,
      "end": 5514.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5508.74,
      "text": "搞墓地搞房地产搞广告的时候和那个赵化勇,我都没,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.260854,
      "compression_ratio": 1.359375,
      "end": 5520.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5514.74,
      "text": "我不跟他们来往,这些人当中有一样,所有这些人像肖建华,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.260854,
      "compression_ratio": 1.359375,
      "end": 5523.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5520.74,
      "text": "他第一个是不要脸,就曾为骂肖建华,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.260854,
      "compression_ratio": 1.359375,
      "end": 5527.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5523.74,
      "text": "骂什么,你哪一代我咋是骂,怎么够站着,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.260854,
      "compression_ratio": 1.359375,
      "end": 5532.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5527.74,
      "text": "肖建华就带着一帮女保镖,就在四季酒店门口那站两个小时。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.260854,
      "compression_ratio": 1.359375,
      "end": 5537.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5534.74,
      "text": "骂张立,把张立骂到当了儿子面,狗血奔头张立,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.260854,
      "compression_ratio": 1.359375,
      "end": 5539.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5537.74,
      "text": "我错了,我错了,是吧,就这。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.183823,
      "compression_ratio": 1.333333,
      "end": 5545.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5539.74,
      "text": "你们知道了天王几个歌星,他们骂的能,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.183823,
      "compression_ratio": 1.333333,
      "end": 5549.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5545.74,
      "text": "天王都是有老板的嘛,骂的狗血喷头,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.183823,
      "compression_ratio": 1.333333,
      "end": 5555.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5549.74,
      "text": "那天王就像孙子一样,就在这块儿给罚站,是吧,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.183823,
      "compression_ratio": 1.333333,
      "end": 5560.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5555.74,
      "text": "所有的人,你像这个田伟,那领导一过那给人家捶腿,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.183823,
      "compression_ratio": 1.333333,
      "end": 5564.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5560.74,
      "text": "是吧,宋主英一来着人家,哎呀,我穿高跟鞋太高了,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.183823,
      "compression_ratio": 1.333333,
      "end": 5568.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5564.74,
      "text": "脚一推下来,田伟蹲下来给宋主英要按脚,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.168332,
      "compression_ratio": 1.314815,
      "end": 5573.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5568.74,
      "text": "当着人的面,是吧,杨岚往哪儿去,把鞋一吞,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.168332,
      "compression_ratio": 1.314815,
      "end": 5576.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5573.74,
      "text": "旁边这些大老板,还有的是将军呢,过去呀,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.168332,
      "compression_ratio": 1.314815,
      "end": 5581.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5576.74,
      "text": "哎呀,我帮你按个腿,那个杨岚妹妹,是吧,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.168332,
      "compression_ratio": 1.314815,
      "end": 5585.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5581.74,
      "text": "那都是副总参谋长啊,跟着许才后吃饭,是吧,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.168332,
      "compression_ratio": 1.314815,
      "end": 5592.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5585.74,
      "text": "就咱没那个见劲儿,咱没那个见劲儿,七哥,这一个。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.124601,
      "compression_ratio": 1.161491,
      "end": 5597.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5592.74,
      "text": "第二个,能把自相吴征把自己老婆送给无数个人,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.124601,
      "compression_ratio": 1.161491,
      "end": 5601.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5597.74,
      "text": "咱没有这个勇气,实在干不成。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.124601,
      "compression_ratio": 1.161491,
      "end": 5605.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5601.74,
      "text": "第三个,就敢杀人,敢要钱,咱没这个胆。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.124601,
      "compression_ratio": 1.161491,
      "end": 5609.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5605.74,
      "text": "这三样咱都不具备,是吧。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.1665,
      "compression_ratio": 1.290323,
      "end": 5615.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5609.74,
      "text": "那么习家的人,吴泳、吴天贵、安安、悄悄,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.1665,
      "compression_ratio": 1.290323,
      "end": 5618.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5615.74,
      "text": "跟这些人做不做生意,当然做生意了。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.1665,
      "compression_ratio": 1.290323,
      "end": 5623.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5618.74,
      "text": "但为什么就和王家,像那银太地产啊,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.1665,
      "compression_ratio": 1.290323,
      "end": 5628.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5623.74,
      "text": "像那康点啊,像中国金融啊,宗金啊,高艳艳,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.1665,
      "compression_ratio": 1.290323,
      "end": 5631.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5628.74,
      "text": "这些人跟习家坚决不容。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.137138,
      "compression_ratio": 1.293617,
      "end": 5637.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5631.74,
      "text": "为什么?政治上本身就不是一伙的。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.137138,
      "compression_ratio": 1.293617,
      "end": 5642.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5637.74,
      "text": "你像马明哲跟了江,跟了王岐山,平安的,是吧,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.137138,
      "compression_ratio": 1.293617,
      "end": 5647.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5642.74,
      "text": "跟着跟着,最后,他就给习的姐夫有来往。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.137138,
      "compression_ratio": 1.293617,
      "end": 5652.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5647.74,
      "text": "是吧?然后呢,特别是大家知道,马云。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.137138,
      "compression_ratio": 1.293617,
      "end": 5656.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5652.74,
      "text": "马云是百分之百江家的,他看不起习家,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.137138,
      "compression_ratio": 1.293617,
      "end": 5660.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5656.74,
      "text": "看不起习家,甚至认为习随时被干掉。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.103563,
      "compression_ratio": 1.315353,
      "end": 5665.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5660.74,
      "text": "对吧?然后马云是百分之百的,是跟着江家的。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.103563,
      "compression_ratio": 1.315353,
      "end": 5669.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5665.74,
      "text": "但是又跟他竞争,对不对?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.103563,
      "compression_ratio": 1.315353,
      "end": 5673.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5669.74,
      "text": "所以说你看到,习家在经济上赚了大钱现在,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.103563,
      "compression_ratio": 1.315353,
      "end": 5678.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5673.74,
      "text": "但是人家不跟他玩。他搞的是科技领域。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.103563,
      "compression_ratio": 1.315353,
      "end": 5683.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5678.74,
      "text": "所以现在习家查腐败,查来查去,他一定会被他们干掉。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.103563,
      "compression_ratio": 1.315353,
      "end": 5688.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5683.74,
      "text": "或者是他一定把这些人全部干掉。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.137466,
      "compression_ratio": 1.142012,
      "end": 5693.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5688.74,
      "text": "两边想有一边完整的活下来的可能性,绝对没有。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.137466,
      "compression_ratio": 1.142012,
      "end": 5698.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5693.74,
      "text": "对我们爆料革命来讲,你追哪家死哪家活,跟我求关系。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.137466,
      "compression_ratio": 1.142012,
      "end": 5702.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5698.74,
      "text": "是吧?我们现在不想证明这里没有一个好人。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.220501,
      "compression_ratio": 1.265432,
      "end": 5708.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5702.74,
      "text": "不管是习、王、江、孟、曾,还是王民,没有好人。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.220501,
      "compression_ratio": 1.265432,
      "end": 5711.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5708.74,
      "text": "他是体制内的就没有好人。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.220501,
      "compression_ratio": 1.265432,
      "end": 5715.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5711.74,
      "text": "相对来讲,王民只好社没好钱,没杀人。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.220501,
      "compression_ratio": 1.265432,
      "end": 5721.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5715.74,
      "text": "对吧?但是王岐山、孟建柱、戴永阁,是吧?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.202736,
      "compression_ratio": 1.323741,
      "end": 5724.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5721.74,
      "text": "那栗战书这杀人多了去了。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.202736,
      "compression_ratio": 1.323741,
      "end": 5733.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5730.74,
      "text": "所以说,天下为公正道。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.202736,
      "compression_ratio": 1.323741,
      "end": 5736.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5733.74,
      "text": "我们做不出我们是人,我们做不出,对了。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.202736,
      "compression_ratio": 1.323741,
      "end": 5738.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5736.74,
      "text": "因为我们是人,他们是魔。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.202736,
      "compression_ratio": 1.323741,
      "end": 5740.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5738.74,
      "text": "所以说咱真做不出来。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.115932,
      "compression_ratio": 1.25523,
      "end": 5743.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5740.74,
      "text": "你现在给我们一次选择。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.115932,
      "compression_ratio": 1.25523,
      "end": 5746.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5743.74,
      "text": "给一辈子这样,咱也做不出来。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.115932,
      "compression_ratio": 1.25523,
      "end": 5749.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5746.74,
      "text": "是吧?邓家贵也搞大了。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.115932,
      "compression_ratio": 1.25523,
      "end": 5753.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5749.74,
      "text": "吴天贵、邓家贵,都是贵他们家习家。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.115932,
      "compression_ratio": 1.25523,
      "end": 5754.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5753.74,
      "text": "所以说咱们搞不出来。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.115932,
      "compression_ratio": 1.25523,
      "end": 5757.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5754.74,
      "text": "那么今天,当我们谈到这些人的时候,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.115932,
      "compression_ratio": 1.25523,
      "end": 5759.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5757.74,
      "text": "请大家高度关注。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.115932,
      "compression_ratio": 1.25523,
      "end": 5764.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5759.74,
      "text": "中国共产党现在下面的经济大亨们,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.131969,
      "compression_ratio": 1.305344,
      "end": 5771.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5764.74,
      "text": "你所知道的,今天你能数上名的没有一个不是权贵的白手套。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.131969,
      "compression_ratio": 1.305344,
      "end": 5776.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5771.74,
      "text": "包括任正非。任正非是绝对是给习家宇来往的。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.131969,
      "compression_ratio": 1.305344,
      "end": 5779.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5776.74,
      "text": "和邓家贵绝对是好的。是吧?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.131969,
      "compression_ratio": 1.305344,
      "end": 5780.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5779.74,
      "text": "还有中兴啊。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.131969,
      "compression_ratio": 1.305344,
      "end": 5783.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5780.74,
      "text": "你现在温家宝就不用提了。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.131969,
      "compression_ratio": 1.305344,
      "end": 5787.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5783.74,
      "text": "我现在只谈到了王岐山、孟建柱和曾庆红。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.131969,
      "compression_ratio": 1.305344,
      "end": 5793.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5789.74,
      "text": "一个国家的财富就被增加戴永阁、增为,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.202337,
      "compression_ratio": 1.309013,
      "end": 5799.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5793.74,
      "text": "史文清。还有一个王阳。还有舒焕章。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.202337,
      "compression_ratio": 1.309013,
      "end": 5802.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5799.74,
      "text": "和王敏安就拿走这么多钱。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.202337,
      "compression_ratio": 1.309013,
      "end": 5806.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5802.74,
      "text": "一个,这宋主英这一炮,42亿人民币,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.202337,
      "compression_ratio": 1.309013,
      "end": 5808.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5806.74,
      "text": "打了多少炮咱们不知道啊。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.202337,
      "compression_ratio": 1.309013,
      "end": 5813.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5808.74,
      "text": "这个,跟这个杨岚。杨岚这一整也是几十亿。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.202337,
      "compression_ratio": 1.309013,
      "end": 5816.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5813.74,
      "text": "上百亿。什么这电瓶车那电瓶车的,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.202337,
      "compression_ratio": 1.309013,
      "end": 5819.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5816.74,
      "text": "还把宝马给买了呢。是吧?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.19886,
      "compression_ratio": 1.0,
      "end": 5823.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5819.74,
      "text": "这就是,你们能知道从爆料革命以来,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.19886,
      "compression_ratio": 1.0,
      "end": 5825.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5823.74,
      "text": "我让你从那个海航的七八七,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.19886,
      "compression_ratio": 1.0,
      "end": 5830.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5825.74,
      "text": "姚敬和张松桥和海航,到现在闻死不动。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.213852,
      "compression_ratio": 1.349206,
      "end": 5836.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5830.74,
      "text": "中国反腐,不是越反越腐,或者越反,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.213852,
      "compression_ratio": 1.349206,
      "end": 5840.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5836.74,
      "text": "这个腐败有个不是的。反着反着腐,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.213852,
      "compression_ratio": 1.349206,
      "end": 5843.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5840.74,
      "text": "那个反字就被拿过来了,就被腐反了。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.213852,
      "compression_ratio": 1.349206,
      "end": 5847.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5845.74,
      "text": "反着反着腐就腐反了。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.206015,
      "compression_ratio": 1.194286,
      "end": 5850.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5847.74,
      "text": "现在最牛的人,你动得了吗?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.206015,
      "compression_ratio": 1.194286,
      "end": 5857.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5850.74,
      "text": "徐家印,张松桥,戴永阁,曾伟,你动得了吗?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.206015,
      "compression_ratio": 1.194286,
      "end": 5859.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5857.74,
      "text": "永远的牺牲品就是王敏。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.206015,
      "compression_ratio": 1.194286,
      "end": 5863.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5859.74,
      "text": "包括你的史文清,舒焕章,王阳。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.206015,
      "compression_ratio": 1.194286,
      "end": 5866.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5863.74,
      "text": "你算啥呀?就给你牺牲掉了。可怜吧?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.119023,
      "compression_ratio": 1.305936,
      "end": 5872.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5866.74,
      "text": "据我所知,所有中纪委办案的人,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.119023,
      "compression_ratio": 1.305936,
      "end": 5875.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5872.74,
      "text": "中纪委是王岐山天下,政法委是孟的天下,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.119023,
      "compression_ratio": 1.305936,
      "end": 5878.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5875.74,
      "text": "怎么轮得着你习说话了呢?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.119023,
      "compression_ratio": 1.305936,
      "end": 5881.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5878.74,
      "text": "现在你让大家选择,几乎百分之百会选,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.119023,
      "compression_ratio": 1.305936,
      "end": 5887.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5881.74,
      "text": "站在曾家和王岐山和孟家,江家,没有人站在习家。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.119023,
      "compression_ratio": 1.305936,
      "end": 5892.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5888.74,
      "text": "所以说,反腐反腐就被腐给反了。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.149797,
      "compression_ratio": 1.305732,
      "end": 5896.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5892.74,
      "text": "习反腐,叫腐反习。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.149797,
      "compression_ratio": 1.305732,
      "end": 5898.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5896.74,
      "text": "这最后一定是这个结局。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.149797,
      "compression_ratio": 1.305732,
      "end": 5903.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5899.74,
      "text": "所有这些过程当中,都是被人家抛出来的牺牲品。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.149797,
      "compression_ratio": 1.305732,
      "end": 5907.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5903.74,
      "text": "如果你还不醒来,那就是你活该。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.149797,
      "compression_ratio": 1.305732,
      "end": 5910.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5907.74,
      "text": "如果你还不醒来,就是你活该。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.192017,
      "compression_ratio": 1.103896,
      "end": 5923.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5910.74,
      "text": "吴征和杨岚有感情吗?我的天哪,同战哪。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.192017,
      "compression_ratio": 1.103896,
      "end": 5927.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5923.74,
      "text": "你这一句话,我觉得今天我直播白播了。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.192017,
      "compression_ratio": 1.103896,
      "end": 5933.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5927.74,
      "text": "有感情你会把你的女人送去,让别人天天去戳去吗?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.18491,
      "compression_ratio": 1.41784,
      "end": 5938.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5933.74,
      "text": "什么样的感情你能把他送出去,把子宫都给戳没了?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.18491,
      "compression_ratio": 1.41784,
      "end": 5945.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5938.74,
      "text": "什么样的感情你能问出这样的话来呀?战友们。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.18491,
      "compression_ratio": 1.41784,
      "end": 5950.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5945.74,
      "text": "所以说,有时候啊,这王岐山有时候说的话,我有时候也想。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.18491,
      "compression_ratio": 1.41784,
      "end": 5953.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5950.74,
      "text": "这王岐山这个王八蛋还有这个孟建柱啊,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.18491,
      "compression_ratio": 1.41784,
      "end": 5956.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5953.74,
      "text": "说中国人啊,就是没有开支一帮育民。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.115313,
      "compression_ratio": 1.310204,
      "end": 5963.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5956.74,
      "text": "愚蠢的,连猪都不如。你给他自由,你给他民主,你给他尊重,他把你弄死了。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.115313,
      "compression_ratio": 1.310204,
      "end": 5969.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5963.74,
      "text": "这帮人都是没开话的这些渔民们,就得把他们当猪狗对待,当奴隶对待。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.115313,
      "compression_ratio": 1.310204,
      "end": 5977.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5969.74,
      "text": "这话很难听。但是我看到这次打疫苗,还有爆料革命走到今天,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.115313,
      "compression_ratio": 1.310204,
      "end": 5982.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5977.74,
      "text": "我确实能看到很多战友,真的是不开话。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.150355,
      "compression_ratio": 1.303665,
      "end": 5987.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5982.74,
      "text": "你看看刚才那战友问的话,吴征和杨兰还有感情吗?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.150355,
      "compression_ratio": 1.303665,
      "end": 5992.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5987.74,
      "text": "你问出这样的话,如果吴征告诉你,我很爱杨兰呐,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.150355,
      "compression_ratio": 1.303665,
      "end": 6000.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5992.74,
      "text": "我好有感情呐,你信吗?那杨兰的子宫都没了,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.150355,
      "compression_ratio": 1.303665,
      "end": 6011.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 6002.74,
      "text": "那吴征不知道吗?是吧?他那个子宫是糜烂,是不是?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.130303,
      "compression_ratio": 1.245098,
      "end": 6020.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 6012.74,
      "text": "我现在欢迎杨兰来告我,你别吴征告我,我希望杨兰你告我,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.130303,
      "compression_ratio": 1.245098,
      "end": 6025.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 6020.74,
      "text": "咱到医院检查你有没有子宫。我就想达到这一个目的。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.130303,
      "compression_ratio": 1.245098,
      "end": 6030.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 6025.74,
      "text": "还有刚才的语音当中,当事人能不能作证,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.130303,
      "compression_ratio": 1.245098,
      "end": 6035.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 6030.74,
      "text": "当时你和王敏的事,他会出来作证吧?对吧?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.131099,
      "compression_ratio": 1.104,
      "end": 6041.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 6035.74,
      "text": "赵本山出不来,赵本山旁边有人啊,赵本山的很多当事人都出来了,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.131099,
      "compression_ratio": 1.104,
      "end": 6047.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 6041.74,
      "text": "已经是我们的战友了,当时都在场的,是吧?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.221832,
      "compression_ratio": 1.288889,
      "end": 6052.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 6047.74,
      "text": "宋主英很聪明啊,跟王敏书记睡完以后,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.221832,
      "compression_ratio": 1.288889,
      "end": 6056.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 6052.74,
      "text": "把床上的东西马上给扔到那个浴缸里去啊,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.221832,
      "compression_ratio": 1.288889,
      "end": 6061.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 6056.74,
      "text": "都扔到浴缸去啊,咱这个战友现在,我相信一定会在这看的啊,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.221832,
      "compression_ratio": 1.288889,
      "end": 6064.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 6061.74,
      "text": "咱战友说,他说,孙主英很聪明,很老脸,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.180738,
      "compression_ratio": 1.314286,
      "end": 6070.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 6064.74,
      "text": "杨岚就不在乎,睡完,床上是不是黏糊糊的,也不在乎,是吧?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.180738,
      "compression_ratio": 1.314286,
      "end": 6078.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 6071.74,
      "text": "王敏书记还喝的那壮阳,壮阳是什么丸子,小方瓶的,金色的,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.180738,
      "compression_ratio": 1.314286,
      "end": 6082.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 6078.74,
      "text": "你看王敏书记能喝酒,但是他跟人家睡的时候,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.180738,
      "compression_ratio": 1.314286,
      "end": 6087.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 6082.74,
      "text": "跟杨岚第一次喝了壮阳药,他都也不去折盖,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.180738,
      "compression_ratio": 1.314286,
      "end": 6091.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 6087.74,
      "text": "但是宋主英很聪明,把床单拽掉,东西全拿掉,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.188216,
      "compression_ratio": 1.22449,
      "end": 6094.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 6091.74,
      "text": "扔到那个浴缸里,水一泡,你就检查不出来了,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.188216,
      "compression_ratio": 1.22449,
      "end": 6100.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 6094.74,
      "text": "他怕有人留证据。咱的战友你们竟然问到这样话啊,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.188216,
      "compression_ratio": 1.22449,
      "end": 6104.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 6100.74,
      "text": "你这是什么情商啊,兄弟姐妹们,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.188216,
      "compression_ratio": 1.22449,
      "end": 6110.74,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 6105.74,
      "text": "你觉得吴征爱杨岚吗?有感情吗?我别播了。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.188216,
      "compression_ratio": 1.22449,
